+// set that way. One rule behind the rings' sweep and the card's bars — callers clamp to what
+// they draw, so an overspent limit reads empty rather than negative. As the Mac's Percent.metered
+// does. Colours never come through here: how bad a reading is stays a question about what was spent.
+function meteredFraction(f,showRemaining){ return showRemaining?1-f:f; }
